# PART 2 — THE PRODUCT VISION

## What is ShieldNet Hub?

ShieldNet Hub is an intelligent, multi-tenant property commerce and estate operations ecosystem that connects property developers, estate owners, agents, buyers, investors and estate management teams through one digital platform.

It brings the entire property business lifecycle into one connected environment:

- Property discovery.
- Estate advertising.
- Property inventory.
- Customer acquisition.
- Sales management.
- Agent management.
- Viewing appointments.
- Reservations.
- Payment monitoring.
- Buyer relationship management.
- Investment relationship management.
- Estate operations.
- Infrastructure monitoring.
- Business intelligence.
- AI-powered automation.

The platform should enable a developer to advertise an estate, manage its inventory, capture prospective buyers, coordinate agents, monitor transactions, serve existing customers and oversee estate operations from one business environment.

At the same time, members of the public should be able to discover properties from different participating developers through one central marketplace.

## The fundamental concept

ShieldNet Hub has TWO connected environments:

**ENVIRONMENT A: PUBLIC PROPERTY MARKETPLACE**

The public-facing property discovery and commerce environment.

**ENVIRONMENT B: PRIVATE BUSINESS WORKSPACES**

The secure, role-based environment through which developers, agents, managers, buyers, investors and ShieldNet administrators interact with the platform.

These two environments must be connected through shared, authorised backend services and a properly designed multi-tenant database.

