# PART 9 — THE AI AGENT ECOSYSTEM

ShieldNet Hub must have an integrated fleet of specialised AI agents.

Agents must not operate as unrelated chatbots.

They should be connected to authorised platform data and controlled backend tools.

### Initial AI agents

1. Lead Acquisition Agent.
2. Lead Qualification Agent.
3. Property Matching Agent.
4. Customer Follow-up Agent.
5. Viewing Appointment Agent.
6. Sales Copilot.
7. Payment Monitoring Agent.
8. Investor Relations Agent.
9. Estate Operations Agent.
